---
import '../styles/pages/about.scss';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
    <section class="about-section card">
        <h2>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">account_circle</span>&nbsp;About Rien Gupta
        </h2>

        <div class="about-content">
            <img src="/assets/people/profile.jpg" alt="Rien Gupta profile picture" class="profile-picture" />

            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Hi, I'm Rien Gupta, the creator of StudyWise.</p>
                <p>As a student interested in both mathematics and the potential of AI, I wanted to build a tool that could bridge the gap between homework assignments and genuine understanding. Too often, we complete problems without fully grasping the underlying concepts.</p>
                <p>This tool leverages generative AI to analyze the types of problems you're working on and create personalized study materials – not just giving you answers, but helping you learn *how* to arrive at them. It generates explanations, worked examples, practice problems, and key definitions tailored to your homework.</p>
                <p>My goal is to make learning math more intuitive and effective. I hope StudyWise helps you study smarter and build confidence in your math skills!</p>
                <p>
                    Feel free to connect with us or provide feedback! <br />
                    Rien Gupta:
                    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/riengupta/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=linkedin" alt="LinkedIn" class="social-icon" /> <span class="text">Connect on LinkedIn</span></a>
                    <!-- | <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=github" alt="GitHub" class="social-icon" /> <span class="text">GitHub</span></a> --><br />
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section card">
        <h2>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">account_circle</span>&nbsp;About Adarsh R. Kumar
        </h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <img src="/assets/people/adarsh.jpeg" alt="Adarsh Kumar profile picture" class="profile-picture" />
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Hi, I'm Adarsh Kumar, 18 years old, and a High School Student at d.Tech.</p>
                <p>I joined forces with Rien Gupta on StudyWise because I'm passionate about math and the power of technology to make learning more accessible and engaging. Together, we aim to create tools that not only assist students with homework but also deepen their understanding of core concepts.</p>
                <p>I believe that learning should be an exciting journey, and I'm motivated to help others discover the joy of mastering new topics. Whether it's through coding, design, or thoughtful problem-solving, I want to contribute to building educational tools that make a real difference.</p>
                <p>
                    Adarsh R. Kumar:
                    <a href="https://adarshrkumar.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">language</span> <span class="text">Website</span></a> |
                    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/adarshrkumar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=linkedin" alt="LinkedIn" class="social-icon" /> <span class="text">Connect on LinkedIn</span></a> |
                    <a href="https://github.com/adarshrkumar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=github" alt="GitHub" class="social-icon" /> <span class="text">GitHub</span></a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>